.TH AVR\-WORKFLOW\-LIST 1 "" "avr 0.3.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-workflow-list \- List workflows with aggregate run stats.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr workflow list
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List workflows with aggregate run stats.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr workflow list
    avr workflow list --repo acme/web
    avr workflow list --since 7d
    avr workflow list --limit 5
    avr workflow list --since all
    avr workflow list --json name,runs,median_duration_seconds
.fi
.RE
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS
    completed_runs, failure_count, flaked_count, median_duration_seconds, name,
    path, platform_workflow_id, repository, runs, workflow_id
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter by repository (org/repo or rep-xxx ID, repeatable). (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fITEXT\fR
Time window: '30d', '7d', '24h', or 'all'. (default: 30d)
.TP
\fB\-L\fR, \fB\-\-limit\fR \fIINTEGER RANGE\fR
Max workflows to show. (default: 20)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-workflow (1),
.BR avr-workflow-run (1),
.BR avr-workflow-view (1)
